@productId = 1

### INVENTORY - Import stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/import
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "productId": {{productId}},
  "quantity": 20,
  "note": "Nhập kho test bằng REST Client"
}

### INVENTORY - Adjust stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "productId": {{productId}},
  "newQuantity": 25,
  "note": "Kiểm kho test bằng REST Client"
}

### INVENTORY - Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/transactions?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### INVENTORY - Transactions by product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/transactions?productId={{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### INVENTORY - Low stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/low-stock?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### PERMISSION TEST - Cashier cannot import stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/import
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}

{
  "productId": {{productId}},
  "quantity": 5,
  "note": "Request này phải bị chặn quyền"
}
